# error-tab-indent

## Input

```
	key value
a 1

```

## CST

```
SOURCE_FILE@0..15
  ERROR@0..11
    STRING@0..10 "\tkey value"
    NEWLINE@10..11 "\n"
  ENTRY@11..15
    WORD_KEY@11..12
      WORD@11..12 "a"
    SPACE@12..13 " "
    INTEGER@13..14
      NUMERAL@13..14 "1"
    NEWLINE@14..15 "\n"
```

## Syntax Error

```
[
    SyntaxError {
        message: "tab is not allowed in indentation",
        range: 0..1,
    },
]
```

## AST

```
SourceFile {
    items: [
        Entry {
            key: WordKey {
                word: WORD@11..12 "a",
            },
            value: Integer {
                sign: none,
                numeral: NUMERAL@13..14 "1",
            },
        },
    ],
}
```

